# Backend Rules

## Language

Use TypeScript.

Maintain strict type safety.

Do not use `any` unless there is a documented reason.

## Express

Follow Express 5 conventions.

Keep middleware, routes, controllers, services and repositories separated by responsibility.

## Controllers

Follow the existing controller style:

```ts
export const featureController = {
  method(req, res) {
    // ...
  }
};